<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's BCN 1996 net 144.755 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's BCN 1996 net 144.755 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private bank Banco de Credito Nacional (BCN) issued the following statement on its 1996 consolidated results.</p>
<p>					   1996	     1995</p>
<p>    net profit		144.755 million     138.930 million</p>
<p>    net worth		 934.819 million     812.537 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais. The bank said it showed a 15.5 percent return on equity in 1996 and a net profit per 1,000 stocks of 2.51 reais.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485412))</p>
